    t.validators().add(blockIssueIfChecklistIsNotComplete)
}
```

3. Save and test the script. The function `blockIssueIfChecklistIsNotComplete` will be executed when the issue is being moved to the next column, and it checks whether all items in the checklist are marked as done. If not, an error message is displayed and the transition is prevented.

